'''Cherry''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is cherry red in color, hence the name. The guard is black, and the handle is solid black with a red tint. The unreleased version appears visually identical in the exception that its blade is pink in color instead of red.

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the now offsale Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/1856115349/Knife-of-lolololeris Knife of lolololeris].
*Cherry’s unreleased version was published to the Roblox Library by [[Nikilis]] on April 22, 2021.<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/6711852603/Cherry The model of the unreleased version]</ref>

